      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.3,
      "end_seconds": 295.92,
      "duration_seconds": 12.62,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a refractive problem or early cataracts do well once it's treated properly. I want a dilated eye examination done, that's for blurred vision"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.94,
